{
  "source": "Oploverz",
  "captured": "2026-11-11",
  "note": "API answers captured from backapi.oploverz.ac. episodes.json and episode.json are trimmed to the one episode whose upbolt player page was captured (upbolt_player.html, the answer to the play-button form). Every series slug is served by that series. master.m3u8 is a hand-written stand-in with the real variant layout.",
